    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm seeing some weird damage on my tomato plants in the greenhouse. There are these tiny, irregular holes appearing on the older leaves, and it's spreading through the rows pretty fast. I haven't seen any obvious bugs on the stems, but the leaves are definitely being eaten. Any idea what might be causing this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
