    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the list. i've looked really closely at the stems and the undersides of the leaves and i just can't find anything. no white specks, no tiny flies, nothing. it's almost like something is just coming in at night or hiding really well. is there anything else that could cause holes without leaving much of a trace?",
